{"id":"004b454b6cf02e89","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-polynomial-operation.md","title":"Polynomial Operation","display":"Polynomial Operation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-polynomial-operation","aliases":["93-lem-polynomial-operation"],"display":"Polynomial Operation","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-polynomial]]","[[93-df-term]]","[[93-lem-term-operation]]","[[93-lem-polynomial-characterization]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-polynomial-operation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-polynomial-operation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Polynomial Operation"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f40774d4e625146e\" href=\"?note=f40774d4e625146e\" title=\"93-df-polynomial\">93-df-polynomial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f76d7169bd6833b\" href=\"?note=1f76d7169bd6833b\" title=\"93-lem-term-operation\">93-lem-term-operation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad928579e25d9ea2\" href=\"?note=ad928579e25d9ea2\" title=\"93-lem-polynomial-characterization\">93-lem-polynomial-characterization</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-polynomial-operation---Polynomial-Operation\">lem-polynomial-operation - Polynomial Operation</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T_{\\tau}(X_{n+m})\">\\(t\\in T_{\\tau}(X_{n+m})\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\\in|\\mathbf A|^m\">\\(\\bar a\\in|\\mathbf A|^m\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:|\\mathbf A|^n\\to|\\mathbf A|\">\\(p:|\\mathbf A|^n\\to|\\mathbf A|\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}\\)</span> are the evaluation constructor and type-indexed predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f40774d4e625146e\" href=\"?note=f40774d4e625146e\" title=\"93-df-polynomial\">93-df-polynomial</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land p:|\\mathbf A|^n\\to|\\mathbf A|\n\\land t\\in T_{\\tau}(X_{n+m})\\land\\bar a\\in|\\mathbf A|^m\\land\n\\forall\\bar b\\in|\\mathbf A|^n\\;\\Bigl(p(\\bar b)=\n\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}(t,\\bar b,\\bar a;\\mathbf A,\\tau,n,m)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(p,\\mathbf A,n;\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m,n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land p:|\\mathbf A|^n\\to|\\mathbf A|\n\\land t\\in T_{\\tau}(X_{n+m})\\land\\bar a\\in|\\mathbf A|^m\\land\n\\forall\\bar b\\in|\\mathbf A|^n\\;\\Bigl(p(\\bar b)=\n\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}(t,\\bar b,\\bar a;\\mathbf A,\\tau,n,m)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(p,\\mathbf A,n;\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Substituting parameters into a term operation yields a polynomial operation.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-polynomial-operation---Polynomial-Operation","text":"lem-polynomial-operation - Polynomial Operation","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"f40774d4e625146e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-polynomial]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-lem-term-operation","status":"resolved","id":"1f76d7169bd6833b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-lem-term-operation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-lem-polynomial-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"ad928579e25d9ea2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-lem-polynomial-characterization]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"f40774d4e625146e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}$ are the evaluation constructor and type-indexed predicate of [[93-df-polynomial]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in T_{\\tau}(X_{n+m})","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar a\\in|\\mathbf A|^m","display":false},{"tex":"p:|\\mathbf A|^n\\to|\\mathbf A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land p:|\\mathbf A|^n\\to|\\mathbf A|\n\\land t\\in T_{\\tau}(X_{n+m})\\land\\bar a\\in|\\mathbf A|^m\\land\n\\forall\\bar b\\in|\\mathbf A|^n\\;\\Bigl(p(\\bar b)=\n\\operatorname{PolyEval}_{93}(t,\\bar b,\\bar a;\\mathbf A,\\tau,n,m)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{PolOp}_{93}(p,\\mathbf A,n;\\tau).","display":true}],"bytes":1189,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f40774d4e625146e","ca7404158049be33","1f76d7169bd6833b","ad928579e25d9ea2"]}